  "description": "Intuitive. Unreal. I don’t know how to describe it anymore. You have to buy one and experience it for yourself. Telepathy gives you truly consistent cornering - less than 7mm of wheelbase shift vs the 50-80 mm of the other bikes on the market. Substantial cornering radius variation as the bike compresses, or constant cornering radius, what do you want? The Parallel Axle Path yields more front wheel traction by adding weight to the front wheel without requiring you to lean forward. Pumping and compressing the bike does it for you. This is a more stable position and it feels magic in a loose corner. Now you can run high rise bars without washing out your front wheel. If you like being bent over the bars of your papier mâché cruise ship, or you like something you can lift with your pinky, this is not for you. If you want a badass rig designed with no holds barred to be the best, this is it. It is metal. It is made in Montana. Preorder yours now. - Matt Lessmeier",
